\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Aeromar suffers over-the-charge for trial, SAT  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 673 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Mai 2020\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  Exchange Commission raised the amount of the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  program it has to expand the mechanism it has been using over the past three years by $10 billion to the usability to secure the price of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and thereby avoid the risks of volatility facing the Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market by international financial turbulence.\par \par \uc2 Thus, the Commission, which is composed of the secretary of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  and Public Credit, \uc2 Arturo Herrera\uc2 , and the governed \uc2 Bank of Mexico\uc2 , Alejandro D\u237\'00\'EDaz de Le\u243\'00\'F3n, in addition to two undersecretaries and two members of the governing board of the \uc2 Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , decided to increase the available amount of that program in order to auction exchange rate coverage of up to 30 billion dollars.\par \par \uc2 Until now, the maximum amount of exchange rate coverage that the Mexican government could issue through \uc2 Banco de M\u233\'00\'E9xico\uc2  was $20 billion. To date, Mexico's financial authorities have auctioned $5.5 billion auctions, which in the face of the program's increase would allow them to issue 24 billion more in exchange rate hedges.\par \par \uc2 By purchasing the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  hedges issued by the Government of Mexico, purchasers will be able to secure the value of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in pesos in the future at a price determined at a certain price at present. Thus, if the exchange rate is at a weaker level than the acquired hedging, the Mexican government will buried the difference in the price of the dollar in pesos so that the economic operator can buy the dollars without having to disburse more resources.\par \par \uc2 If, on the other hand, the exchange rate depreciates less than expected in hedging, then economic operators will have lost the value of the hedging as they will be able to buy the dollars on the market at a lower price than they expected.\par \par \uc2 Thus, hedges cause \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market participants to not have to suffer volatility by being able to secure a future value for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Over the past few days, global financial markets have shown marked volatility due to the economic and social impact that could result from covid-19 contagion, as well as recent energy announcements by major crude oil producers globally," the Exchange Commission said in a statement. "In this environment, the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in our country has also been more volatile."\par \par \uc2 So "with the aim of . . .\u160\'00\'A0maintain an orderly functioning of the exchange market . . . [the] Commission has decided to increase the size of the liquidable exchange hedge programme by difference in national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," the unit added.\par \par \uc2 The objective of hedging is not, nor was it in the past, to defend a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  contribution level, but to ensure that the market trades with sufficient liquidity by providing a tool to economic operators to better plan their future dollar \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The exchange rate hedge programme began in February 2017 to provide \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market participants with a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  toolplanner against the volatility that the weight experienced at the time by the arrival of Donald J. Trump in the US presidency. The protectionist stances of the then new U.S. representative generated nervousness in Mexican financial markets, hitting the peso.\par \par \uc2 Since then, multiple auctions of these hedges have been held, something the government will be doing in the future.\par \par \uc2 "The Commission may convene at any time and immediately carry out auctions of these instruments," the Commission added. "The Exchange Commission reaffirms its commitment to continue to assess the conditions of \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the exchange market and, if necessary, take additional actions."\par \par \uc2 The announcement by the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  authorities gave a slight respite to the Mexican peso in after-hours \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The peso wholesale price against the dollar was strengthened from 21.06 units per dollar prior to the announcement to 20.7 units.\par \par \uc2 However, the Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  officially closed with a 5% drop from Friday's close, a second crash after Friday's 6% fall.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020200514eg5d0006z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
