\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 "Weight has strengthened despite coronavirus," says AMLO\b0\par\par\uc2 411 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Februar 2020\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 MEXICO CITY, February 14.- President \uc2 Andr\u233\'00\'E9s Manuel L\u243\'00\'F3pez Obrador\uc2  said that, despite the spread of coronavirus and the uncertainty that this generates, the Mexican peso and economy have been strengthened, unlike other nations.\par \par \uc2 "I know that this which I say bothers our adversaries a lot, that they are going to challenge it, but I will give a hard thing: this year for the coronavirus, among other factors, it has greatly affected the world economy, so far the year (but) the only \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  that has been strengthened , which has been appreciated, despite the coronavirus is the weight. "Only India and everyone else have lost and more of the Chilean peso, the same euro," he added.\par \par \uc2 "It is true there is an international atmosphere of financial, economic uncertainty, but we are fortunately fine, it is not to throw the bells, but if it has acted well"\par \par \uc2 At a press conference at Palacio Nacional, the head of the Federal Executive noted that due to the economic actions that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  and Public Credit (SHCP) \uc2 has promoted "and the government at large, very cautiously in public finances, did not heofile the country"\par \par \uc2 "We have the advantage that among other things, it was decided from the beginning to strengthen the popular economy, the family economy, invest down, to protect most people, we are doing this. Investments of resources for peoples are unique in history, in volume, in money that is reaching the people below, that is important"\par \par \uc2 "We were fortunate that remittances grew like never before. They reached $36 billion, so much money had been received from our countrymen to their relatives, that's why they're "living heroes," because that money goes down"\par \par \uc2 Celebrates Low \uc2 Banxico\uc2  Interest Rate\par \par \uc2 Andr\u233\'00\'E9s Manuel L\u243\'00\'F3pez Obrador\uc2  also celebrated the \uc2 Bank of Mexico\uc2 's downgrade of interest rate to 7%, since, he said, this will help make it more likely to obtain loans, and economic growth is further boosted.\par \par \uc2 "I welcome the fact that the \uc2 Bank of Mexico\uc2  has lowered the interest rate to 7% this helps because there is more possibility for borrowing, interest costs less and economic growth is boosted."\par \par \uc2 The representative indicated that the \uc2 Bank of Mexico\uc2  is autonomous, noting that his government "is very interested in deciding at the \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  professionally, in a technical way, without political \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , that is why our respect for the autonomy of the \uc2 Bank of Mexico\uc2 ".\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020200214eg2e00dea\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
