\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 The \uc2 Bank of Mexico\uc2 , a useless white elephant?\b0\par\par\uc2 525 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Juli 2019\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 In a country with a strong, organic economy with strong institutions, a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could operate with the dual function of seeking inflationary stability and boosting full employment.\par \par \uc2 But Mexico is far from this economic strength and institutional strength that would allow the \uc2 Bank of Mexico (Banxico) \uc2 to have the dual function, without ending up as a scapegoat for the government's failures.\par \par \uc2 When some aspire to make the \uc2 Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  a driver of growth, without neglecting inflation, they are thinking of the \uc2 Us Federal Reserve\uc2  (Fed), without taking into account the maturity of a developed economy that does not face many of the challenges \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  today, now aggravated by the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventionism\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the 4T.\par \par \uc2 In a country like \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 , where there are controlled prices, monopoly public tariffs, an informal and illegal economy that alters price formation, where there is a government that has no slam in slamming into wage increases, assistance is a list of resources public, or the setting of off-market guarantee prices, with an exchange rate that relatively easily transfers its price weaknesses, it is very difficult to ask its \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to behave like a first-world institution with a mandate in two Addresses.\par \par \uc2 Open the \uc2 Banxico\uc2  website and the first thing you will find in huge letters is the legend: "\uc2 Banxico\uc2 's priority objective is to keep inflation low and stable." If curiosity wins, this legend leads him to the description of article 2 of the Law of the \uc2 Bank of Mexico\uc2 , which accounts for its purpose of providing the country's economy with national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , promoting the healthy development of the payment system and promoting good functioning payment system. That legend is his defense.\par \par \uc2 What we are clear about is that President \uc2 Andr\u233\'00\'E9s Manuel L\u243\'00\'F3pez Obrador\uc2  would like this article to include something like that the priority objective is also to promote full employment, which is a way of calling for the promotion of economic growth.\par \par \uc2 Now imagine that Morena's solicitous lawmakers hear the president say that the \uc2 Banxico\uc2  should in addition to controlling inflation, support growth, but the law prevents it.\par \par \uc2 Well, there are already some rapprochements between senators and advisers of the \uc2 Banxico\uc2  and the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  to explore the possibility of expanding the scope of monetary policy towards promoting growth, beyond putting levees to the elevation messy prices.\par \par \uc2 Mexico's economy has shown that with a strong \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  it can cope with inflationary pressures, as has happened since the mid-1990s, when \uc2 Banxico\uc2  gained its autonomy.\par \par \uc2 If the economy wants to grow at higher rates, more work is needed on the factors of confidence, macroeconomic stability, strength of the energy industry and consolidation of institutions, beyond personal enlightenment.\par \par \uc2 Passing the ball of growth responsibility to \uc2 Banxico\uc2  would only make that institution an obese, clumsy body. Come on, a white elephant unable to compete against the vagaries of discretionary fiscal policy management.\par \par \uc2 The cherry on the cake of a developed, structured, institutional economy with full attachment to the rule of law can be a \uc2 Banxico\uc2  with dual function. Before that, impossible.\par \par \uc2 [email protected]\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020190725ef7p000vg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
