\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 They raise "indicators of well-being"\b0\par\par\uc2 728 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2019\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The government of President \uc2 Andr\u233\'00\'E9s Manuel L\u243\'00\'F3pez Obrador\uc2  suggested to the \uc2 Bank of Mexico (Banxico) \uc2 to include "welfare indicators" in its economic policy measurements.\par \par \uc2 After that, last week, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  made an adjustment to the economic growth range for this year, of 1.7 and 2.7% at a range of between 1.1 and 2.1%, the spokesman of the Presidency of the Republic, Jes\u250\'00\'FAs Ram\u237\'00\'EDrez, He considered that \uc2 Banxico\uc2  should not only have as its mandate the management of inflation and monetary policy, but also the standard of living of citizens.\par \par \uc2 Interviewed by El Economista , the spokesperson said that it is not an \b \highlight22\uc2 interventionism\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \uc2 Banxico\uc2 , and stressed that the autonomous body can, by itself, include the "indicators of well-being", although it left open the possibility of reforms to the Law of the Bank from Mexico. Ram\u237\'00\'EDrez Cuevas also reproached the measurements of the National Council for the Evaluation of Social Development Policy (Coneval) and the National Institute of Statistics and Geography (Inegi).\par \par \uc2 - The president analyzes the indicators of the \uc2 Bank of Mexico\uc2 , because he dismissed the cut to the growth of this year of the \uc2 Banxico\uc2 ? (Ram\u237\'00\'EDrez Cuevas was asked).\par \par \uc2 -There is a debate about the indicators. As there was a debate about the Inegi, his way of measuring unemployment so that the unemployment rate was lower. There is also a manipulation of the way in which the indicators are presented. Coneval himself, when he measures poverty, may technically be correct, but as he communicates it, it already has a political effect; It is a political decision. So, they are not aseptic organisms. The \uc2 Bank of Mexico\uc2  itself, which has a mandate, which includes the management of inflation and monetary policy as the only macroeconomic indicators. We have proposed that the \uc2 Bank of Mexico\uc2  also include the standard of living, that is, the level of welfare should be part of the economic balance.\par \par \uc2 -How could I measure it?\par \par \uc2 - You measure it by changing the mandate of the \uc2 Bank of Mexico\uc2 , or that the bank assumes.\par \par \uc2 - With a reform?\par \par \uc2 -Yes, with a reform.\par \par \uc2 -But what is included, for example?\par \par \uc2 -Well, consumption, standard of living, well-being, income, and that if the income goes well, because inflation says we control it, and we control the price of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and other factors of the trade balance, but the level of people, the wellness? So, since it is part of the balance sheet of a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  that is concerned about the nation, not only the financial and economic sectors; that is why we believe that it should have a mandate like that, and that it does not affect anything, because it is not \b \highlight22\uc2 interventionism\b0 \highlight\uc2 , maintaining its autonomy, but including these indicators so that people have a reference and the leaders have a reference, and economic actors have that same reference.\par \par \uc2 - That would be with a legal reform?\par \par \uc2 -The \uc2 Bank of Mexico\uc2  can do it, of itself, as a decision to include welfare indicators as part of its economic policy considerations.\par \par \uc2 -It's a suggestion?\par \par \uc2 -It is a suggestion, and we have said it since the campaign, but we are not emphasizing on that; That would be desirable, we must see what path to follow, without feeling that we want to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the internal life of the \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but it is adequate. If the economy has a human destiny, the end of the economy is that there is social welfare, it would be logical that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  that is in charge of the variables, include the human variableas measurable to see where we are going, not only technical-economic variables. But that is part of the reflection on the economy and the changes that are going to take place. The approach is more regional and sectors are being promoted, for example, if in the field everything was oriented to production for export, now it is about focusing on the production of food and the improvement of the productive capacities of the peasants, of small and medium producers; the big ones will also be supported, but since the children have been abandoned, and (the programs) Aserca and Procampo and all those programs that were, were focused on the big ones, now they are going to focus more towards the family unit more little.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020190304ef34000yc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
