ion of a possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  (Banxico) \uc2 in the Mexican exchange market, with an increase in the funding rate or directly with sale of dollars in the spot market, or through increasing the amount of their \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hedges.\par \par \uc2 CI Banco consider & oacute; that a possible action by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will have short-term impact, both in duration and in magnitude.\par \par \uc2 In the primary market, the rate of & nbsp; & nbsp; Certificates of the Treasury of the Federation (Cetes) to 28 days could register an increase or remain unchanged; meanwhile, the yield for the 10-year bonds in the secondary market could move between 7.95 and 8.10%, estim.gov.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020180618ee6i005hu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
