\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 They ask to remove Bouquet 23 and Commission of Changes\b0\par\par\uc2 249 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Mai 2018\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The Mexican Institute of Finance Executives (IMEF) presented its agenda aimed at shaping the National Development Plan for the next Administration, which includes eliminating Branch 23 and the Exchange Commission. In a press conference, Fernando L\u243\'00\'F3pez Macari, national president of the IMEF, explained that it is a project in process that will be presented to the candidate who wins the elections on July 1, and later to the new cabinet. The agenda consists of four main axes: Economic Policy; Good government; Social and Business Responsibility, as well as the Rule of Law. Among the economic policy proposals, the elimination of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Commission stands out, in order to give full responsibility to the \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the determination of the exchange policy, without the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Commission is in charge of the exchange policy, it is chaired by the Secretary of the Treasury and consists of three officials from this department and three from \uc2 Banxico\uc2 . Another one of the points indicated in fiscal subjects is the elimination of the Branch 23, budgetary branch for the allocation of federal resources, with whose elimination the discretionality and opacity of the use of resources in that area would be fought, indicated Lopez Macari. Among other points, of the first axis, it considers macroeconomic stability, the implementation of a fiscal reform, improvements in commercial policy and promotion of productive investment.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020180530ee5u002pe\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
