\par\par \b \uc2 POLL-Mexico, Brazil  \highlight22\uc2 currencies \highlight\uc2  set to weaken less on dovish Fed, \uc2 ECB\b0\par\par\uc2 521 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 August 2017\par 08:15\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2017 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 * reuters://realtime/verb=Open/url=cpurl://apps.cp./Apps/\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 -polls?RIC=BRL= poll data\par \par \uc2 By Bruno Federowski\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO, Aug 3 (Reuters) - Brazilian and Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  will weaken less than previously thought against the U.S. dollar during the next 12 months as low interest rates abroad offset political uncertainty at home, a Reuters poll found on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The fresh forecasts come in the wake of a stronger-than-expected performance for both \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the first seven months of 2017, which drove them to their strongest levels in more than a year.\par \par \uc2 Still, estimates from top banks and research firms suggest the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  probably will give back part of their recent gains.\par \par \uc2 The Mexican peso is seen at 18.115 per dollar in 12 months versus 18.5 in July, having outperformed all major emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year as fears of a U.S. trade war abated. The Brazilian real is expected to weaken to 3.35 per dollar from 3.42.\par \par \uc2 Elsewhere in the region, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategists polled by Reuters forecast the Argentine peso at 18.865 in a year, the Chilean peso at 666.5, the Colombian peso at 3,039 and the Peruvian sol at 3.38 to the greenback.\par \par \uc2 Emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are expected to benefit from resilient appetite for high-yielding assets throughout the world as the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  and the \uc2 European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (\uc2 ECB\uc2 ) take their time in unraveling monetary stimulus.\par \par \uc2 Although U.S. economic growth has shown signs of accelerating, an unexpectedly slow pickup in price hikes has made analysts skeptical of the Fed's stated plan of increasing interest rates once more this year and three times next year.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, euro zone inflation remains far below the \uc2 ECB\uc2 's target of close to 2 percent, driving policymakers to hold off paring back bond purchases meant to stimulate activity.\par \par \uc2 That prospect is likely to provide support to the Brazilian real and the Mexican peso, despite both countries facing highly uncertain general elections in 2018 that have stoked trader fears of a populist swing. A series of interest rate hikes and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  also have fostered trust in the strength of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In Brazil, concerns that corruption allegations against President \uc2 Michel Temer\uc2  could derail his plans to streamline the country's bloated social security system also seem to have been put off in the short-term.\par \par \uc2 "So far, the political crisis hasn't impacted the risk perception in Brazil in any meaningful way," Ivo Chermont, an economist with investment boutique Quantitas, said. "We'll only begin to seriously discuss the elections in around six months."\par \par \uc2 Eleven of 12 strategists who replied to an additional question said they saw no potential for regional spillovers from the political crisis in Venezuela.\par \par \uc2 (For other stories from the global \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  poll:) (Additional reporting by Sheky Espejo in Mexico City, Hernan Nessi in Buenos Aires, Nelson Bocanegra in Bogota, Ursula Scollo in Lima and Felipe Iturrieta in Santiago; Editing by Bill Trott) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2017-8-3T07:15:01.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020170803ed83008gn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
