\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Mexico \highlight\uc2  cenbank confirms 2nd  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2 , sells dollars in Asian trade\b0\par\par\uc2 221 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Januar 2017\par 14:59\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2017 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Updates with \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmation)\par \par \uc2 MEXICO CITY, Jan 6 (Reuters) - \uc2 Mexico's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed on Friday it had sold dollars during the Asian trading session on Friday, its second \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  the day after it did the same during Mexican and U.S. trading hours to fight a slump in the peso.\par \par \uc2 At 7:45 a.m. Mexico City time, the peso was up 0.53 percent at 21.31 pesos per dollar.\par \par \uc2 The bank sold dollars in Asian trading hours, according to an official who declined to be named. The bank did not confirm the amount or exact timing of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been battered by the election of \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  as U.S. president, who has threatened to scrap a trade deal between Mexico and the United States and block money transfers.\par \par \uc2 He has also attacked companies that invest in Mexico to produce goods to be sold in the United States.\par \par \uc2 On Thursday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold at least $1 billion in U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in morning trade, four traders told Reuters, asking not to be identified because they were not authorized to speak publicly.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Noe Torres and Roberto Aguilar; Editing by Chizu Nomiyama) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2017-1-6T14:59:28.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020170106ed1600qju\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
