\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Mexico's Carstens sees no need for extraordinary rate-setting meeting\b0\par\par\uc2 244 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Mai 2016\par 15:49\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2016 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Adds quote and context)\par \par \uc2 MEXICO CITY, May 26 (Reuters) - Mexico's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor \uc2 Agustin Carstens\uc2  said on Thursday that at the moment he saw no reason to hold an extraordinary board meeting on rate-setting policy.\par \par \uc2 "We don't see an imminent reason or an extraordinary reason for having an extraordinary meeting," Carstens told a local radio station.\par \par \uc2 In its quarterly inflation report on Wednesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  maintained its 2016 economic growth forecast at between 2.0-3.0 percent, but trimmed its view for 2017 slightly to between 2.3-3.3 percent.\par \par \uc2 A sharp drop in \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso pushed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in February to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets for the first time since 2009 and to raise interest rates unexpectedly after an unannounced meeting.\par \par \uc2 Asked whether the bank could hike rates again before the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  doe so, Carstens said in the Thursday interview that although there had been volatility in the peso, inflation had been below the target level for a year.\par \par \uc2 "Never say never but I'd say, given what we've seen up to now and the amount of time until our next meeting, I think it won't be necessary to call an extraordinary meeting to take any interest rate measures," he said. (Reporting by Christine Murray; Editing by W Simon) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2016-5-26T14:49:50.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020160526ec5q019ls\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
